      "escalation": "Answered 21 Aug 26 from the contract: date-bounded per-account querying is supported (Client_code, FromDate, ToDate all mandatory); paging is not offered. The read-through stands and no entry mirror is needed. FMS bounds its own ranges and pages within them."
