      "escalation": "No channel-grant registry exists in any document. Ask the platform team that registers X-Service-Principal, for the grant AND the template keys with their declared parameters. Empirical check: submit one whatsapp notification in non-production; 403 channel_not_permitted is a definitive no."
    },
    {
      "id": "TASK-04",
      "blocks": [
        "TASK-15"
      ],
      "escalation": "Held as a Phase 1 gate. TechExcel's Ledger carries SETL_PAYINDATE and MKT_TYPE (M-T+1 Normal, Z-T+1 Trade to trade) per trade entry, which suggests Rule B4 needs no calendar arithmetic and EB-9 returns to gating Phase 3 as the PRD had it. Unchanged pending back-office confirmation, because the finding relaxes rather than tightens, and a partial correction would contradict hld.md and traceability.md."
    },
    {
      "id": "TASK-05",
      "blocks": [
        "TASK-31"
      ],
      "escalation": "Phase 3 does not ship until authentication rules on out-of-band protection."
    }
